  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To assist about 10,000 persons in the most vulnerable among the urban poor in ger areas of Ulaanbaatar where the majority of low-income households live with very limited basic services, to generate additional income by scaling up community-led infrastructure development activities.</narrative>
